<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-GIO half year net profit jumps.</title>
<headline>RTRS-GIO half year net profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    141.5 vs 112.3</p>
<p>    Net				     102.5 vs  83.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     10.0 vs   9.0</p>
<p>NOTE: GIO Australia Holdings Ltd is an insurance group.  </p>
<p>    Premium income			790.6 vs 716.4</p>
<p>    Other income			  500.7 vs 361.0</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    17.1 vs 14.7</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date Apr 15</p>
<p>Reg date Mar 14</p>
<p>    Tax					40.1 vs 29.3</p>
<p>    Interest				 46.5 vs 40.9</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    9.8 vs 9.6</p>
<p>    Minorities		     credit 1.1 vs credit 0.8</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
